  m_text: 'Daniel Pierce worked inside a quiet university archive, surrounded by
    photographs, documents, and old records.

    At first, everything looks organized.

    But
    the deeper he searches, the clearer it becomes that someone altered the evidence
    and removed the truth from history.'
